{"id":"nbe479ae312","headline":"Survey Finds 15% of Japanese Companies Experience Customer Harassment","summary":"Roughly 15% of Japanese companies suffered customer harassment over the past year, according to a corporate survey. Businesses are stepping up countermeasures after legislation mandating preventive action took effect in October 2026.","why":"Workplace and customer-conduct rules affect labour costs, staffing and service operations at Japanese employers. Investors watch such regulation for its effect on corporate operating expenses.","category":"economy","event_type":"labor","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Tokyo","country":"Japan","lat":35.68,"lon":139.69,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Nippon.com","url":"https://www.nippon.com/en/articles/-/57486"},"sources":[{"name":"Nippon.com","url":"https://www.nippon.com/en/articles/-/57486"}],"published_at":"2026-11-16T20:59:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T08:41:28Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"7814c9e4af0d5330","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T08:41:28Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-11-16T20:59:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-11-16T23:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/office-meeting-3196481.jpg","alt":"office meeting (illustration)","credit":"AymaneJed","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/laptop-office-hand-writing-3196481/"}}